Priority: optional
Maintainer: loopcatcher maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Build-Depends: build-essential, debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/jefonseca/loopcatcher

Package: loopcatcher
Architecture: all
Depends:
 bash,
 dbus,
 pulseaudio-utils,
 vorbis-tools,
 fdkaac
Description: Record Linux app/system loopback audio to AAC or OGG files
 loopcatcher routes an application sink input into a monitor sink and encodes
 loopback audio into AAC or OGG while preserving metadata when available.
 It supports interactive TUI controls and stores runtime configuration under
 ~/.config/loopcatcher.
